n.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/09/02/35289349.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=1280&sh=960&sl=W&fw=800&exp=3600","url":"https://udn.com/news/story/124652/9729777","mainEntityOfPage":"https://udn.com/news/story/124652/9729777","headline":"桃龍潭綠營分裂？張肇良妻吳平娥登記 民進黨提名張贊聞：全力以赴","articleSection":"要聞","datePublished":"2026-09-02T14:29:27+08:00","dateModified":"2026-09-02T14:41:49+08:00","keywords":"張肇良,綠營,民進黨,2026九合一選舉,桃園市選舉","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/09/02/35289349.jpg&M=1","url":"https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/09/02/35289349.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=1280&sh=960&sl=W&fw=800&exp=3600","name":"民進黨在桃園市龍潭區議員選區提名張贊聞，張今天完成登記。記者張裕珍／攝影","height":"1000","width":"800"},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"聯合新聞網"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"聯合新聞網","url":"https://udn.com","sameAs":"https://www.facebook.com/myudn/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"http://p.udn.com.tw/upf/static/common/amp_logo_news.png","height":60,"width":600}}},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Article","thumbnailUrl":"https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/09/02/35289349.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=1280&sh=960&sl=W&fw=800&exp=3600","url":"https://udn.com/news/story/124652/9729777","mainEntityOfPage":"https://udn.com/news/story/124652/9729777","headline":"桃龍潭綠營分裂？張肇良妻吳平娥登記 民進黨提名張贊聞：全力以赴","articleSection":"要聞","datePublished":"2026-09-02T14:29:27+08:00","dateModified":"2026-09-02T14:41:49+08:00","keywords":"張肇良,綠營,民進黨,2026九合一選舉,桃園市選舉","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/09/02/35289349.jpg&M=1","url":"https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/09/02/35289349.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=1280&sh=960&sl=W&fw=800&exp=3600","name":"民進黨在桃園市龍潭區議員選區提名張贊聞，張今天完成登記。記者張裕珍／攝影","height":"1000","width":"800"},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"聯合新聞網"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"聯合新聞網","url":"https://udn.co